602	    /** Whether the user's role may take `action` on the sheet: the roles set for it, else the standing
603	     *  rule — open, settle, void, close and today (changing the sheet's today) by clerk and steward;
604	     *  reassign and reopen by steward. A
605	     *  viewer may take none, and no one may on an archived sheet. */
606	    public boolean allows(String sheetId, String action, String user) {
